      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "Passwords are often the only barrier protecting your data against unauthorised access with serious consequences. And yet, many people are careless with their passwords. Reason enough to launch the ‘Year of the Password’ as part of the IT Security Initiative. Are you ready to get yourself a password that will always be secure? Here are our recommendations and tips!"
